                <pb facs="0257" n="247" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg247"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.01/12–2049: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in the Philippines</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Cowen</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-12-27T17:00:00-05:00">December 27,
                            1949—5 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1564. Dept expects keep Phil Govt fully informed in advance any definitive step
                    on part US to recognize Chi Commies. Dept sympathetic Phil Govt desire avoid
                    appearance fol US lead in this matter. Keurtel 2880 Dec 20.</p>
                <p>You may in ur discretion so inform Phil Govt.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
